"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"_iDDqhphfpvrDxKjFa9Ofw","review_id":"29gWILEjTv2WUI0BHPhtBA","date":"2021-01-28T17:51:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398711323738098,"text_excerpt":"I've never seen this spot not busy. La Boulangerie offers a wide selection of morning pastries, desserts, and menu with breakfast and lunch items. They do full service coffee bar too. The croissant breakfast sandwich is my favorite! I've had the caprese sandwich and quiche. The quiche is super good too. The bake goods aren't the best in the city but they are definitely solid choice. The service is good and consistent. It's a large space with indoor and outdoor seating. It's a great place to meet up with a friend or colleague. I even see folks coming in with laptops to do a bit of work/study while they enjoy the pastries."},{"business_id":"_iDDqhphfpvrDxKjFa9Ofw","review_id":"QvwZifU9h9EWG87Rvx6WhA","date":"2019-10-12T15:35:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9355523586273193,"text_excerpt":"I think I found my new favorite spot. The location is fantastic! Inside: air conditioning, booths, regular tables, clean bathrooms, smells delicious. The staff is super friendly and nice. The food: everything we tried was amazing! The avocado toast, fresh with a touch of lime juice, crunch from the seeds. The pretzel was warm and cheesy. What's not to like. Their coffee is not the best, I recommend you telling them how you want it.(be specific). Type of milk, if you wanted sweet or coffee-milk ratio. Baked goods: Napoleon wasn't my favorite but it wasn't bad. Maybe because I had the Halloween one? Let me tell you the chocolate bread pudding was the best, cold or warm. If you can try it! T..."},{"business_id":"_iDDqhphfpvrDxKjFa9Ofw","review_id":"FZQLJs8z3WZsqkVkhn4odA","date":"2018-06-11T23:54:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.93503737449646,"text_excerpt":"All good things. I swear, I can't think of a single thing I'd change about La Boulangerie except to move it to my kitchen and make everything free. I have to explain up front that bread could be considered an entree in my world, and every bread I've had here has been amazing. The baguette is my favorite, but that doesn't diminish the love I have for all their other breads. I've only had a few things here because I've just been a customer for a short while. I have to sing the praises of their croissants too. So buttery and rich. And their cappuccino is top notch. Bold and very flavorful. Parking on Magazine can be tough, but it's such a beautiful area that I don't mind a walk from a block ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"_iDDqhphfpvrDxKjFa9Ofw","photo_id":"YcRAAz0rBmh7m0u5g5FZsA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YcRAAz0rBmh7m0u5g5FZsA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8619900345802307},{"business_id":"_iDDqhphfpvrDxKjFa9Ofw","photo_id":"J0eRAmXG6YLeA7rgXb24sQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/J0eRAmXG6YLeA7rgXb24sQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8489122986793518},{"business_id":"_iDDqhphfpvrDxKjFa9Ofw","photo_id":"lBGaGpx2kT_EPt17B7d0dA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/lBGaGpx2kT_EPt17B7d0dA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8370375633239746},{"business_id":"_iDDqhphfpvrDxKjFa9Ofw","photo_id":"pHh1GrjR2TG5KcL5ZKjOnw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/pHh1GrjR2TG5KcL5ZKjOnw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8033521771430969},{"business_id":"_iDDqhphfpvrDxKjFa9Ofw","photo_id":"K1xXGRhWkgV_5mg0eIHo3w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/K1xXGRhWkgV_5mg0eIHo3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7975281476974487}]},"notebook_case":null}
